                <pb facs="0084" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg78"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dun to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 72.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-14"><hi rendition="#italic">November 14,
                        1894</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received November 15.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cable instructions received 8tb; answer delayed by the absence of Japanese
                    minister for foreign affairs. He will return to-night; expect answer
                    to-morrow.</p>
            </div>
